# Serwist build output. `next build` writes this (swDest: "public/sw.js") and
# mints a fresh Next build id every time, so the committed copy went stale the
# moment anyone built and left the tree dirty on every build afterwards.
# Nothing reads it from git: the service worker is disabled in development, and
# CI and Render both regenerate it from src/sw.ts during the build.
apps/web/public/sw.js
